04572"],"id":"2115744532994404572","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":15473,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":32,"retweet_count":0},"text":"说实话，这类币我平时看得不多，但最近翻 @veloprotocol 的走势，越看越顺眼：底部一点点抬高，回调也没再创新低，量能慢慢在放，有点蓄力的意思。光看图我不会推，真正让我愿意多看几眼的，是它背后的东西。\n\nVELO 做的是 PayFi，简单说就是让稳定币真正能拿来花、能转账、能变现。 https://t.co/SipqaPvPis","url":"https://x.com/gcsbtc/status/2115744532994404572"},{"author_id":"36659991","created_at":"2026-10-29T09:50:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115743063515570553"],"id":"2115743063515570553","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4128,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"text":"这是刷到的第二例来自中国iPhone Duo铰链顶破屏幕的例子，也是一样的位置，不同的是在屏幕被顶破后才发现。\n\n目前苹果公司承认存在裂屏，但是没有披露具体原因，只是让用户去走售后，也没有召回的迹象。 https://t.co/t3FqLvNaNb https://t.co/8gyBk0if3Z","url":"https://x.com/kenw_2/status/2115743063515570553"},{"author_id":"1823248694805962752","created_at":"2026-10-29T09:50:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115742940236857515"],"id":"2115742940236857515","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20294,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":52,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这谁做过？ https://t.co/VldMsw2fJB","url":"https://x.com/Sexytodashu/status/2115742940236857515"},{"author_id":"51904755","created_at":"2026-10-29T09:47:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115742186998497288"],"id":"2115742186998497288","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":6057,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"X算法开源后，对擅长运营的人更有利，还是对真正的内容创作者更有利？\n\n@grok 你表达下态度。","url":"https://x.com/Morris_LT/status/2115742186998497288"},{"author_id":"24124203","created_at":"2026-10-29T09:35:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115739171583385943"],"id":"2115739171583385943","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":48,"impression_count":35153,"like_count":157,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":92,"retweet_count":5},"text":"我的 C